cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "docforensics-layout-s: document layout analysis for degraded pages"
message: "If you use this model, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Canworks, LLC"
    alias: "Ginexys"
    website: "https://ginexys.com"
    email: "contact@ginexys.com"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-01
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
contact:
  - name: "Ginexys, a d/b/a of Canworks, LLC"
    email: "contact@ginexys.com"
abstract: >
  An 8.8 MB document layout detector for damaged, scanned and photographed
  pages. Detects fifteen region types including form fields, and reports eight
  page-condition signals. Reaches 0.449 mAP@50-95 on degraded scans where a
  larger YOLOv8n baseline reaches 0.194.
keywords:
  - document layout analysis
  - document forensics
  - degraded documents
  - form understanding
